{%- doc -%}
  The two hearts inside every wishlist toggle: an outline while the product is
  not saved and a filled heart once it is. wishlist.js only flips `is-active` /
  aria-pressed on the button; critical.css shows the matching heart. Both use
  currentColor, so each button's own color rules still apply.
{%- enddoc -%}
<span class="wishlist-heart wishlist-heart--off" aria-hidden="true">
  {{- 'icon-heart.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
</span>
<span class="wishlist-heart wishlist-heart--on" aria-hidden="true">
  {{- 'icon-heart-fill.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
</span>
